e/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pervasive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-pessimistic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"pessimistic","sort_order":1,"sense":"悲觀的","alt_zh":"高中生擔心看穩固模型橋，同學與成年老師溫和鼓勵。","example":"The pessimistic student expected the model to fail before the test began.","example_zh":"悲觀學生在測試前就認為模型會失敗。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pessimistic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-placid-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"placid","sort_order":1,"sense":"平靜的","alt_zh":"鏡面湖水倒映白雲遠山，高中生從有護欄岸邊觀景臺欣賞。","example":"The placid lake reflected the clouds perfectly.","example_zh":"平靜湖面完整映出白雲。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/placid-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-plight-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"plight","sort_order":1,"sense":"困境","alt_zh":"成年志工在安全收容中心尊重地提供家庭毛毯與食物。","example":"The volunteers responded to the plight of families displaced by the flood.","example_zh":"志工回應洪水後失去住所家庭的困境。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/plight-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-plummet-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"plummet","sort_order":1,"sense":"暴跌；驟降","alt_zh":"高中老師指向無字溫度折線圖的陡降段，旁有日落教具。","example":"The temperature began to plummet after sunset.","example_zh":"日落後氣溫開始驟降。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/plummet-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-poignant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"poignant","sort_order":1,"sense":"感人的","alt_zh":"成年校友與高中生看已故教師助人的老照片，溫暖思念。","example":"The old photographs formed a poignant reminder of the teacher's kindness.","example_zh":"老照片感人地提醒大家老師的善良。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/poignant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-potent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"potent","sort_order":1,"sense":"強效的；濃烈的","alt_zh":"成年美術老師監督高中生將少量深色顏料混入一大碗白色顏料。","example":"A tiny amount of the potent pigment changed the whole mixture's color.","example_zh":"一點濃烈顏料就改變整碗混合物的顏色。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/potent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-precarious-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"precarious","sort_order":1,"sense":"不穩定的","alt_zh":"高中生與成年老師在桌上扶穩輕巧木塔模型，指出狹窄底座。","example":"The tall tower stood in a precarious balance on its narrow base.","example_zh":"高塔在狹窄底座上處於不穩平衡。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/precarious-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-precedent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"precedent","sort_order":1,"sense":"先例","alt_zh":"兩個高中音樂社與成年指揮合奏後開心握手。","example":"The successful shared rehearsal set a precedent for future cooperation.","example_zh":"成功共同排練為未來合作建立先例。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/precedent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-preclude-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"preclude","sort_order":1,"sense":"排除","alt_zh":"高中生與成年老師停在門外，量尺顯示模型寬過門框。","example":"The narrow entrance would preclude moving the large model into the room.","example_zh":"狹窄入口使大型模型無法搬進房間。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/preclude-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-preeminent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"preeminent","sort_order":1,"sense":"卓越的","alt_zh":"受敬重成年歷史學家向高中生展示古港模型與文物。","example":"The preeminent historian visited the school to discuss the old harbor.","example_zh":"卓越歷史學家到學校談論老港口。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/preeminent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prohibit-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prohibit","sort_order":1,"sense":"禁止","alt_zh":"成年保育員與高中生留在護欄外用望遠鏡遠距觀鳥。","example":"The reserve's rules prohibit visitors from approaching the nests.","example_zh":"保護區規定禁止訪客靠近鳥巢。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prohibit-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prolific-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prolific","sort_order":1,"sense":"多產的","alt_zh":"成年作曲家整理許多樂譜本，高中樂團在旁試奏，無可讀譜字。","example":"The prolific composer wrote music for many school concerts.","example_zh":"多產作曲家為多場校園音樂會譜曲。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prolific-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-propensity-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"propensity","sort_order":1,"sense":"傾向","alt_zh":"高中女生在自然館熱切向成年導覽員提問並記錄觀察。","example":"Her propensity to ask questions made every visit a learning opportunity.","example_zh":"她愛提問的傾向，使每次參訪都成為學習機會。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/propensity-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-purport-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"purport","sort_order":1,"sense":"聲稱","alt_zh":"高中生與成年老師在故事工作坊研究不可讀舊信與虛構島圖。","example":"The old letter purported to reveal the treasure's location.","example_zh":"那封老信聲稱揭露寶藏位置。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrat