webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-succumb-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"succumb","sort_order":1,"sense":"屈服；抵擋不住","alt_zh":"成年園丁與高中生從安全距離查看倒下腐朽小木柵欄。","example":"The old fence finally succumbed to years of rain.","example_zh":"老柵欄終究抵擋不住多年雨淋。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/succumb-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-superfluous-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"superfluous","sort_order":1,"sense":"多餘的","alt_zh":"高中生與成年老師比較素雅木盒和過量緞帶，保持簡潔。","example":"The extra decoration was superfluous on the simple wooden box.","example_zh":"簡單木盒上的額外裝飾顯得多餘。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/superfluous-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-supplant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"supplant","sort_order":1,"sense":"取代","alt_zh":"成年館員與高中生在電腦旁整理舊索引卡櫃，螢幕無字書本圖示。","example":"The new digital catalog began to supplant the old card system.","example_zh":"新數位目錄開始取代舊卡片系統。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/supplant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-surmount-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"surmount","sort_order":1,"sense":"克服","alt_zh":"高中生與成年老師分類再利用乾淨餘木，完成模型橋。","example":"The team found a way to surmount the shortage of materials.","example_zh":"團隊找到克服材料短缺的方法。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/surmount-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-sustain-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"sustain","sort_order":1,"sense":"維持","alt_zh":"成年園丁與高中生用儲存雨水澆灌茂盛菜苗。","example":"Regular care helped sustain the garden through the dry season.","example_zh":"定期照料幫助花園度過乾季、維持生長。","image_url":"https://jb