anguage.","example_zh":"他們的友誼能超越語言差異。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/transcend-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-transient-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"transient","sort_order":1,"sense":"短暫的","alt_zh":"成年嚮導與高中生從安全觀景臺欣賞逐漸淡去的晚霞。","example":"The transient glow of sunset faded behind the hills.","example_zh":"短暫夕陽光芒在山後漸漸消退。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/transient-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-tremor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"tremor","sort_order":1,"sense":"震動","alt_zh":"成年研究員向高中生展示地震儀與小幅無字波形。","example":"The seismograph recorded a slight tremor.","example_zh":"地震儀記錄一次輕微震動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/tremor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ubiquitous-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ubiquitous","sort_order":1,"sense":"無處不在的","alt_zh":"成年大學生與高中訪客走在安全校道，四周多處整齊自行車停放區。","example":"Bicycles were ubiquitous around the university campus.","example_zh":"大學校園到處都是自行車。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ubiquitous-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-unambiguous-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"unambiguous","sort_order":1,"sense":"明確的","alt_zh":"成年嚮導與高中生看步道入口單一清楚箭頭指向寬敞安全道路。","example":"The unambiguous arrow showed the only safe route.","example_zh":"明確箭頭指出唯一安全路線。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/unambiguous-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-usurp-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"usurp","sort_order":1,"sense":"篡奪","alt_zh":"虛構成年大臣擅坐高位，其他官員疑惑，無武器暴力。","example":"The novel's minister tried to usurp the ruler's authority.","example_zh":"小說中大臣企圖篡奪統治者權威。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/usurp-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-utilitarian-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"utilitarian","sort_order":1,"sense":"實用主義的；重實用的","alt_zh":"成年木匠向高中生展示簡潔耐用、抽屜收納有序的書桌。","example":"The utilitarian desk favored practical storage over decoration.","example_zh":"實用書桌重視收納功能，勝過裝飾。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/utilitarian-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-vain-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"vain","sort_order":1,"sense":"徒勞的","alt_zh":"高中團隊與成年老師查看仍缺一件的模型拼圖與空小盒。","example":"Their vain search ended without finding the missing piece.","example_zh":"他們徒勞搜尋，最後仍沒找到遺失零件。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/vain-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-vanquish-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"vanquish","sort_order":1,"sense":"征服；擊敗","alt_zh":"兩支高中棋隊在成年裁判旁友善專注對弈。","example":"The chess team hoped to vanquish its strongest rival.","example_zh":"棋隊希望擊敗最強對手。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/vanquish-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-venerate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"venerate","sort_order":1,"sense":"尊崇","alt_zh":"成年居民與高中生在圖書館創辦教師肖像前莊重獻花。","example":"The community continued to venerate the teacher who founded the library.","example_zh":"社區持續尊崇創建圖書館的老師。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/venerate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-verbose-01-v1","level":"se